## Player-facing credits and attribution content for the CREDITS page.
##
## ASSETS.md is a repository document and is not exported with the game, so its
## register is transcribed here: one entry per ASSETS.md heading, in the same
## order, carrying the authorship and licence status that register records.
## tests/credits_page_test.gd parses ASSETS.md and fails if a heading is added
## there without a matching entry here. Nothing in this file invents a person:
## the repository records no individual contributor names, so the team is
## credited as the "Mudds Shipyards team".

